# 0d_temple_hall: GunTurret bases u0463/u0463, tops u0464/u0464. Scan both parts, force the base FSM states and the top's
# PowerDown/PowerUp, hurt and kill the top, then leave so the leash runs out (Withdraw).
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/gunturret.py <out> 3bfa3eff,0d_temple_hall --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50
@f320 scan u0464 15 300
@f330 scan u0463 15 300
@f600 fsm u0463 IntoPan
@f700 fsm u0463 PanLeft
@f800 fsm u0463 PanRight
@f900 fsm u0463 AttackExit
@f1000 fsm u0463 Flinch
@f1100 fsm u0463 CloseDoor
@f1200 fsm u0463 OpenDoor
@f1300 fsm u0463 Withdraw
@f1400 fsm u0464 PowerDown
@f1500 fsm u0464 PowerUp
@f1550 fsm u0463 Attack
@f1600 damage u0464 5
@f1700 damage u0464 5 missile
@f1800 fsm u0463 Patrol
@f1900 statecall u0463 IntoPan 0
@f1902 statecall u0463 IntoPan 1 0.016
@f1904 statecall u0463 IntoPan 2
@f1910 statecall u0463 AttackExit 0
@f1912 statecall u0463 AttackExit 1 0.016
@f1914 statecall u0463 AttackExit 2
@f1920 statecall u0463 Withdraw 0
@f1922 statecall u0463 Withdraw 1 0.016
@f1924 statecall u0463 Withdraw 2
@f2000 kill u0464
@f2200 obj u0463; obj u0464
@f2300 tp 162 150 -41
@f2900 obj u0463; obj u0463
@f3000 kill u0464
@f3300 objs GunTurret
